{"subjectId":"api-design","id":"caching","title":"Caching","group":"API Design","order":17,"html":"<p class=\"lead\">The fastest API call is the one you don't make. HTTP has built-in caching primitives — use them.</p>\n<section class=\"block\"><h3><i class=\"ti ti-layers\"></i>Caching layers</h3>\n<div class=\"flow\">\n<div class=\"flow-node\">Client cache</div><div class=\"flow-arrow\">→</div>\n<div class=\"flow-node\">CDN / Edge</div><div class=\"flow-arrow\">→</div>\n<div class=\"flow-node\">Reverse proxy</div><div class=\"flow-arrow\">→</div>\n<div class=\"flow-node\">App cache (Redis)</div><div class=\"flow-arrow\">→</div>\n<div class=\"flow-node\">Database</div>\n</div>\n</section><section class=\"block\"><h3><i class=\"ti ti-list\"></i>HTTP caching headers</h3>\n<div class=\"tabs\"><div data-label=\"Cache-Control\" class=\"tab-panel\">\n<figure class=\"code\"><pre><code>// Public — CDN + browser can cache\nCache-Control: public, max-age=3600\n\n// Private — only browser caches\nCache-Control: private, max-age=300\n\n// Never cache (auth endpoints, mutations)\nCache-Control: no-store\n\n// stale-while-revalidate: serve stale, refresh in background\nCache-Control: public, max-age=60, stale-while-revalidate=600</code></pre></figure>\n</div><div data-label=\"ETag\" class=\"tab-panel\">\n<figure class=\"code\"><pre><code>// Server response:\nETag: \"v2-abc123\"\n\n// Client's next request:\nIf-None-Match: \"v2-abc123\"\n\n// Unchanged → 304 Not Modified (no body = saves bandwidth)\n// Changed → 200 OK + new ETag + new body</code></pre></figure>\n</div><div data-label=\"Vary\" class=\"tab-panel\">\n<figure class=\"code\"><pre><code>// Different languages = different cache entries\nVary: Accept-Language\n\n// NEVER do this — disables CDN caching effectively\nVary: Authorization</code></pre></figure>\n</div></div>\n</section><section class=\"block\"><h3><i class=\"ti ti-alert-triangle\"></i>What to cache vs not</h3>\n<div class=\"grid\">\n<div class=\"card\"><h3><i class=\"ti ti-check\"></i>Safe to cache</h3><div class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">Public product listings</span><span class=\"chip\">Static reference data</span><span class=\"chip\">Product images</span><span class=\"chip\">Public profiles</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3><i class=\"ti ti-x\"></i>Never cache</h3><div class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">Auth tokens</span><span class=\"chip\">Payment endpoints</span><span class=\"chip\">POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE</span><span class=\"chip\">OTP codes</span><span class=\"chip\">Real-time prices</span></div></div>\n</div></section>"}